{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46241","headline":"春游凉泉寺 · 贯休","name":"春游凉泉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一到凉泉未拟归，迸珠喷玉落阶[墀]。\n几多僧祗因泉在，无限松如泼墨爲。\n云堑含香啼鸟细，茗瓯擎乳落花迟。\n青山看着不可上，多病多慵争奈伊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}